# Registry mirrors: curated entries only. Format per line:
#   <https-url> <label> owner=<owner-name> docs=<docs-url> verified=<status>
# Plain http:// URLs are rejected by the modules (HTTPS only).
# verified=pending blocks release (see tests/pre-publish.sh); only the
# maintainer flips it to verified after manual review. Never set it yourself.
